\newlabel{fig:main trees colless dist}{{S3}{4}{\textbf {Main analyses tree symmetry distributions.} Distribution of tree symmetry values measured across the trees used in the main analysis using the corrected Colless index \citep {heard1992patterns}. Lower values indicate more symmetrical trees}{figure.caption.3}{}}
