\newlabel{fig:pairwise dist continuous tip node}{{S15}{14}{Pairwise Euclidean distances between tips and nodes in true ordinations of continuous traits. Distances calculated across all axes from the 100 true continuous ordinations from 50-living taxa subsample}{figure.caption.15}{}}
